# Leaderboard backend — pick ONE, copy this file to .env.local, then restart dev.
# With neither set, the board falls back to localStorage (this browser only).

# --- Option A: dreamlo (no signup) ---------------------------------------
# Visit https://dreamlo.com, click "Get a Leaderboard", copy the two codes.
# Note: the private code ships in the client bundle, so the board is
# public-write. Fine for a joke game, not for anything that matters.
# VITE_DREAMLO_PUBLIC=your_public_code
# VITE_DREAMLO_PRIVATE=your_private_code

# --- Option B: Supabase (free tier, needs an account) ---------------------
# Create a project, then run the SQL in README.md to make the scores table.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://yourproject.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key
